 ends depends on the choices the player makes.<br>In Story Mode, the player not only makes their own story, they also get to construct their own personal Tactical Surface Fighter mecha.  <br>By defeating the BETA and putting together the parts they drop, they\u2019ll get to make their own ultimate fighting machine.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/aaf4dcf9db0ad540fefa5a7cc4f8e7a7.poster.avif?t=1750387846\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/aaf4dcf9db0ad540fefa5a7cc4f8e7a7.webm?t=1750387846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/aaf4dcf9db0ad540fefa5a7cc4f8e7a7.mp4?t=1750387846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/edf45048fb64451184968a923c059024.avif?t=1750387846\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br>A new mode that combines both action and strategy, as you take the role of a nameless surface pilot fighting to save humanity from the BETA threat. <br><br>Survival Mode is a unique game mode which takes place in worlds called \u201cPotentialities\u201d, where you\u2019ll alternate between taking missions from five ideologically different factions and battling back the BETA as they march on Japan. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/49a257c1b6223b3ed2c3d951ee669eec.avif?t=1750387846\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557480/extras/8c0aa9fcba124a6b3845739d4c8dcce5.avif?t=1750387846\" wid